[[:db/add "e054d655-62a4-5394-ac47-ef25847f1064" :answer/id #uuid "e054d655-62a4-5394-ac47-ef25847f1064"] [:db/add "e054d655-62a4-5394-ac47-ef25847f1064" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e054d655-62a4-5394-ac47-ef25847f1064" :answer/value "y=K - \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "e054d655-62a4-5394-ac47-ef25847f1064" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e5e7cc48-efe1-565e-a021-4a7d3578b2f9" :answer/id #uuid "e5e7cc48-efe1-565e-a021-4a7d3578b2f9"] [:db/add "e5e7cc48-efe1-565e-a021-4a7d3578b2f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e5e7cc48-efe1-565e-a021-4a7d3578b2f9" :answer/value "y=K e^{- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}}"] [:db/ensure "e5e7cc48-efe1-565e-a021-4a7d3578b2f9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "85fb30b9-482c-5836-b259-f18647c2ac3a" :answer/id #uuid "85fb30b9-482c-5836-b259-f18647c2ac3a"] [:db/add "85fb30b9-482c-5836-b259-f18647c2ac3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "85fb30b9-482c-5836-b259-f18647c2ac3a" :answer/value "y=K + e^{- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}}"] [:db/ensure "85fb30b9-482c-5836-b259-f18647c2ac3a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ab4eed85-3711-57b4-9b07-9168e188a322" :answer/id #uuid "ab4eed85-3711-57b4-9b07-9168e188a322"] [:db/add "ab4eed85-3711-57b4-9b07-9168e188a322" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ab4eed85-3711-57b4-9b07-9168e188a322" :answer/value "y=K e^{\\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}}"] [:db/ensure "ab4eed85-3711-57b4-9b07-9168e188a322" :answer/validate] [:db/add "efb430f8-926e-55a9-90f2-160fd4d71619" :answer/id #uuid "efb430f8-926e-55a9-90f2-160fd4d71619"] [:db/add "efb430f8-926e-55a9-90f2-160fd4d71619" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "efb430f8-926e-55a9-90f2-160fd4d71619" :answer/value "y=K e^{- 3 x}"] [:db/ensure "efb430f8-926e-55a9-90f2-160fd4d71619" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a5b85e77-d6a2-593a-bb62-e1913ab6c0ec" :answer-field/id #uuid "a5b85e77-d6a2-593a-bb62-e1913ab6c0ec"] [:db/add "a5b85e77-d6a2-593a-bb62-e1913ab6c0ec" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "a5b85e77-d6a2-593a-bb62-e1913ab6c0ec" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "a5b85e77-d6a2-593a-bb62-e1913ab6c0ec" :answer-field/choices "e054d655-62a4-5394-ac47-ef25847f1064"] [:db/add "a5b85e77-d6a2-593a-bb62-e1913ab6c0ec" :answer-field/choices "e5e7cc48-efe1-565e-a021-4a7d3578b2f9"] [:db/add "a5b85e77-d6a2-593a-bb62-e1913ab6c0ec" :answer-field/choices "85fb30b9-482c-5836-b259-f18647c2ac3a"] [:db/add "a5b85e77-d6a2-593a-bb62-e1913ab6c0ec" :answer-field/choices "ab4eed85-3711-57b4-9b07-9168e188a322"] [:db/add "a5b85e77-d6a2-593a-bb62-e1913ab6c0ec" :answer-field/choices "efb430f8-926e-55a9-90f2-160fd4d71619"] [:db/add "a5b85e77-d6a2-593a-bb62-e1913ab6c0ec" :answer-field/correct "e5e7cc48-efe1-565e-a021-4a7d3578b2f9"] [:db/ensure "a5b85e77-d6a2-593a-bb62-e1913ab6c0ec" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "b6e881a1-d03e-538b-b25f-9901e5967e80" :question/id #uuid "b6e881a1-d03e-538b-b25f-9901e5967e80"] [:db/add "b6e881a1-d03e-538b-b25f-9901e5967e80" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $y'+3 xy=0$ for $y\\ne0.$"] [:db/add "b6e881a1-d03e-538b-b25f-9901e5967e80" :question/worked-solution "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y'+3 xy=0 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+3 xy & =0 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- 3 xy \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- 3 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (- 3 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (- 3 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\ln|y| & =- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\ln|y|=- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ By doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\ln|y| & =- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}+C \\\\ |y| & =e^{- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}+C} \\\\ |y| & =e^{- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}}\\cdot e^C \\\\ |y| & =K e^{- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K=e^C$ and $K>0.$\n\nWe can drop the absolute value bars by allowing $K$ to be either positive or negative. Therefore, the most general solution is\n\n$$\ny=K e^{- \\frac{3 x^{2}}{2}}.\n$$"] [:db/add "b6e881a1-d03e-538b-b25f-9901e5967e80" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "b6e881a1-d03e-538b-b25f-9901e5967e80" :question/answer-fields "a5b85e77-d6a2-593a-bb62-e1913ab6c0ec"] [:db/ensure "b6e881a1-d03e-538b-b25f-9901e5967e80" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068841 :knowledge-point/questions "b6e881a1-d03e-538b-b25f-9901e5967e80"] [:db/add "43728ce3-eb2b-5fc6-830f-805a4c28dae0" :answer/id #uuid "43728ce3-eb2b-5fc6-830f-805a4c28dae0"] [:db/add "43728ce3-eb2b-5fc6-830f-805a4c28dae0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "43728ce3-eb2b-5fc6-830f-805a4c28dae0" :answer/value "y=K + e^{- 6 x^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "43728ce3-eb2b-5fc6-830f-805a4c28dae0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "314ddc43-96f1-59a8-8023-3bb59824bbd7" :answer/id #uuid "314ddc43-96f1-59a8-8023-3bb59824bbd7"] [:db/add "314ddc43-96f1-59a8-8023-3bb59824bbd7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "314ddc43-96f1-59a8-8023-3bb59824bbd7" :answer/value "y=K e^{- 12 x}"] [:db/ensure "314ddc43-96f1-59a8-8023-3bb59824bbd7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "504849f0-11de-50f0-9d0f-349aab8ada59" :answer/id #uuid "504849f0-11de-50f0-9d0f-349aab8ada59"] [:db/add "504849f0-11de-50f0-9d0f-349aab8ada59" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "504849f0-11de-50f0-9d0f-349aab8ada59" :answer/value "y=K e^{6 x^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "504849f0-11de-50f0-9d0f-349aab8ada59" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3cd63917-a749-555a-bf9d-2fac66925065" :answer/id #uuid "3cd63917-a749-555a-bf9d-2fac66925065"] [:db/add "3cd63917-a749-555a-bf9d-2fac66925065" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3cd63917-a749-555a-bf9d-2fac66925065" :answer/value "y=K e^{- 6 x^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "3cd63917-a749-555a-bf9d-2fac66925065" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1ee20c7f-6f9d-58e0-