igned}\\int \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (- 12 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (- 12 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\ln|y| & =- 6 x^{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\ln|y|=- 6 x^{2}+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ By doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\ln|y| & =- 6 x^{2}+C \\\\ |y| & =e^{- 6 x^{2}+C} \\\\ |y| & =e^{- 6 x^{2}}\\cdot e^C \\\\ |y| & =K e^{- 6 x^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K=e^C$ and $K>0.$\n\nWe can drop the absolute value bars by allowing $K$ to be either positive or negative. Therefore, the most general solution is\n\n$$\ny=K e^{- 6 x^{2}}.\n$$"] [:db/add "2979f6cd-5c5b-5031-9aef-e33515fe3ba1" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "2979f6cd-5c5b-5031-9aef-e33515fe3ba1" :question/answer-fields "0984a0b2-b439-5c38-8752-ca7940686554"] [:db/ensure "2979f6cd-5c5b-5031-9aef-e33515fe3ba1" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068841 :knowledge-point/questions "2979f6cd-5c5b-5031-9aef-e33515fe3ba1"] [:db/add "f2393c7a-c3d8-5aad-bed7-a830f13b0967" :answer/id #uuid "f2393c7a-c3d8-5aad-bed7-a830f13b0967"] [:db/add "f2393c7a-c3d8-5aad-bed7-a830f13b0967" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f2393c7a-c3d8-5aad-bed7-a830f13b0967" :answer/value "y=K e^{- 2 x^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "f2393c7a-c3d8-5aad-bed7-a830f13b0967" :answer/validate] [:db/add "eefa0af9-582a-593c-b08c-680c52172c6d" :answer/id #uuid "eefa0af9-582a-593c-b08c-680c52172c6d"] [:db/add "eefa0af9-582a-593c-b08c-680c52172c6d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "eefa0af9-582a-593c-b08c-680c52172c6d" :answer/value "y=K + 2 x^{2}"] [:db/ensure "eefa0af9-582a-593c-b08c-680c52172c6d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3d01e966-51d4-5f5f-999e-14a3d35823f8" :answer/id #uuid "3d01e966-51d4-5f5f-999e-14a3d35823f8"] [:db/add "3d01e966-51d4-5f5f-999e-14a3d35823f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3d01e966-51d4-5f5f-999e-14a3d35823f8" :answer/value "y=K e^{2 x^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "3d01e966-51d4-5f5f-999e-14a3d35823f8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8493af28-b3ab-5643-8356-07d1df783a26" :answer/id #uuid "8493af28-b3ab-5643-8356-07d1df783a26"] [:db/add "8493af28-b3ab-5643-8356-07d1df783a26" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8493af28-b3ab-5643-8356-07d1df783a26" :answer/value "y=K e^{4 x}"] [:db/ensure "8493af28-b3ab-5643-8356-07d1df783a26" :answer/validate] [:db/add "11f9cf16-55c7-5532-a0f0-23f1210aa4a3" :answer/id #uuid "11f9cf16-55c7-5532-a0f0-23f1210aa4a3"] [:db/add "11f9cf16-55c7-5532-a0f0-23f1210aa4a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "11f9cf16-55c7-5532-a0f0-23f1210aa4a3" :answer/value "y=K + e^{2 x^{2}}"] [:db/ensure "11f9cf16-55c7-5532-a0f0-23f1210aa4a3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c218409c-26c1-5438-adf5-477c4d837748" :answer-field/id #uuid "c218409c-26c1-5438-adf5-477c4d837748"] [:db/add "c218409c-26c1-5438-adf5-477c4d837748" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "c218409c-26c1-5438-adf5-477c4d837748" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "c218409c-26c1-5438-adf5-477c4d837748" :answer-field/choices "f2393c7a-c3d8-5aad-bed7-a830f13b0967"] [:db/add "c218409c-26c1-5438-adf5-477c4d837748" :answer-field/choices "eefa0af9-582a-593c-b08c-680c52172c6d"] [:db/add "c218409c-26c1-5438-adf5-477c4d837748" :answer-field/choices "3d01e966-51d4-5f5f-999e-14a3d35823f8"] [:db/add "c218409c-26c1-5438-adf5-477c4d837748" :answer-field/choices "8493af28-b3ab-5643-8356-07d1df783a26"] [:db/add "c218409c-26c1-5438-adf5-477c4d837748" :answer-field/choices "11f9cf16-55c7-5532-a0f0-23f1210aa4a3"] [:db/add "c218409c-26c1-5438-adf5-477c4d837748" :answer-field/correct "3d01e966-51d4-5f5f-999e-14a3d35823f8"] [:db/ensure "c218409c-26c1-5438-adf5-477c4d837748" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4a1b84c2-72ff-5b6c-a2d3-124405d3d5d9" :question/id #uuid "4a1b84c2-72ff-5b6c-a2d3-124405d3d5d9"] [:db/add "4a1b84c2-72ff-5b6c-a2d3-124405d3d5d9" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the differential equation $y'-4 xy=0$ for $y\\ne0.$"] [:db/add "4a1b84c2-72ff-5b6c-a2d3-124405d3d5d9" :question/worked-solution "To find the general solution, we first separate the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y'-4 xy=0 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}-4 xy & =0 \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =4 xy \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =4 x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (4 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (4 x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\ln|y| & =2 x^{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation (in implicit form) is\n\n$$\n\\ln|y|=2 x^{2}+C.\n$$\n\nWe're required to write the solution in the form $y=y(x).$ By doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\ln|y| & =2 x^{2}+C \\\\ |y| & =e^{2 x^{2}+C} \\\\ |y| & =e^{2 x^{2}}\\cdot e^C \\\\ |y| & =K e^{2 x^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $K=e^C$ and $K>0.$\n\nWe can drop the absolute value bars by allowing $K$ to be either positive or negative. Therefore, the most general solution is\n\n$$\ny=K e^{2 x^{2}}.\n$$"] [:db/add "4a1b84c2-72ff-5b6c-a2d3-124405d3d5d9" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "4a1b84c2-72ff-5b6c-a2d3-124405d3d5d9" :question/answer-fields "c218409c-26c1-5438-adf5-477c4d837748"] [:db/ensure "4a1b84c2-72ff-5b6c-a2d3-124405d3d5d9" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068841 :knowledge-point/questions "4a1b84c2-72ff-5b6c-a2d3-124405d3d5d9"] [:db/add "9111a873-e65b-50bf-bdd6-54909ccca12a" :answer/id #uuid "9111a873-e65b-50bf-bdd6-54909ccca12a"] [:db/add "9111a873-e65b-50bf-bdd6-54909ccca12a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9111a873-e65b-50bf-bdd6-54909ccca12a" :answer/value "y=K + e^{\\frac{x^{2}}{2}}"] [:db/ensure "9111a873-e65b-50bf-bdd6-54909ccca12a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b118235d-1829-5423-8043-a5f0